Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:39.94,Hdr,,0,0,0,,May 27, 2007 - Japanese Derby
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:03.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,Asakusa Kings in front - Asakusa Kings leads
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.00,0:00:05.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,And Sun Zeppelin is chasing him
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.20,0:00:08.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,Down the middle of the track, the filly Vodka is closing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.60,0:00:10.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,A sudden surge - what a kick!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.90,0:00:14.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,Vodka is sweeping past them all to take the lead
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.30,0:00:17.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,200 metres to go - and it's Vodka in front
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.00,0:00:19.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,Right down the middle, the filly Vodka
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.60,0:00:23.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,Leading 17 colts home - Vodka in front, 100 to go
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.20,0:00:25.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,Asakusa Kings second, then Sun Zeppelin
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.90,0:00:28.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,And Admire Aura is closing, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.60,0:00:30.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,Vodka leads - and wins it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.00,0:00:33.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,Vodka wins!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.10,0:00:36.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,Incredible - for the first time in 64 years, only the third ever
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.40,0:00:38.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,A filly has won the Derby!